hen"] [212 1 "// the metatype's other attributes."] [236 1 "// typeSetAttr is type.__setattr__: a class's attribute, its slots updated for a special one."] [266 1 "// SetAttr is setattr(o, name, v); v nil is delattr."] [274 1 "// DelAttr is delattr(o, name)."] [277 1 "// GetAttrOptional is getattr(o, name) with nil, not an AttributeError, when there is no such attribute."] [280 1 "// LookupSpecial is a special method's lookup on o's type (_PyObject_LookupSpecial): bound to o, or nil."] [289 1 "// getAttrOptional is getattr(o, name, None) without the None: nil when there is no such attribute."] [301 1 "// callBound calls a method found on self's type bound to self (CPython's vectorcall of an unbound"] [302 1 "// method with self first, or __get__ then the call)."] [360 2 "// a descriptor's own attributes (PY6a: inspect's getattr_static reads __name__ and __objclass__)"] [373 2 "// object's attributes"] [408 2 "// BaseException's attributes (exceptions.c's BaseException_getset and members)"] [467 1 "// unpackAll is the items of an iterable."]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[75 31] [79 28] [83 35] [95 6] [95 20] [101 9] [101 23] [104 31] [108 28] [112 35] [123 26] [132 33] [169 28] [187 34] [221 33] [222 27] [225 34] [242 35] [257 38] [268 32] [314 33] [335 18] [353 27] [391 26] [450 58]]} (go/file "attr.go" :imports [

